          "type": "text",
          "text": "Safety inspectors noted high winds during seasonal storms while preparing a replacement frame. Two shorter sides of a triangular frame for the village solar-panel frame are 15 cm and 20 cm. The angle between them must be 90°. Find the required longest side x in centimetres. Enter the numerical value only."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "4.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
